{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"Hecke代数"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"title":[{"Plain":"Hecke 代数"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>Hecke 代数是多处出现的一些不同概念, 但总体上是某些"},{"Local":{"url":"双陪集空间","text":"双陪集空间"}},{"Plain":"上的函数在卷积下构成的代数.</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n"}]}}